      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "CodeGraph: Repository Intelligence | TypeScript, React, Python, FastAPI, Neo4j, LangGraph",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00032",
      "path": "tabs.t.nddzyfo93agp.body.content[32]",
      "tabId": "t.nddzyfo93agp",
      "tabTitle": "working on it",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1797,
      "endIndex": 1986,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.3egcl3kx3uya",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Built React/TypeScript features and Python/FastAPI services for repository intelligence; added 32-way Tree-sitter ingestion, Neo4j file/function/call graphs, and NDJSON progress streaming.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00033",
      "path": "tabs.t.nddzyfo93agp.body.content[33]",
      "tabId": "t.nddzyfo93agp",
      "tabTitle": "working on it",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1986,
      "endIndex": 2161,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.3egcl3kx3uya",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Developed a Claude-powered LangGraph ReAct agent with 7 repository-scoped tools for dependency, blast-radius, external-call, architecture, source, and vector-search analysis.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00034",
      "path": "tabs.t.nddzyfo93agp.body.content[34]",
      "tabId": "t.nddzyfo93agp",
      "tabTitle": "working on it",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2161,
      "endIndex": 2329,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.3egcl3kx3uya",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Built Graph-RAG with Neo4j vector indexes, 1,536-dimensional OpenAI embeddings, and GDS Leiden subgraphs; reduced LLM context 97.5% from 737K to ~18K tokens per query.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00035",
      "path": "tabs.t.nddzyfo93agp.body.content[35]",
      "tabId": "t.nddzyfo93agp",
      "tabTitle": "working on it",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2329,
      "endIndex": 2534,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.3egcl3kx3uya",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Automated Postman API tests for ingestion, graph retrieval, Graph-RAG, and cleanup with NDJSON assertions, negative cases, and HMAC-SHA256 webhook validation; verified with 82 Pytest cases and Node tests.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00036",
